    "Allows you to control a vehicle in a mission twice (but no more per mission). You can only use a backup vehicle in battle modes allowing several respawns. The specified price is the cost of one backup vehicle. You can have several backup vehicles, which are spent as far as they're used.": "购买后，在每场街机娱乐模式的游戏中便能出击两次。 该价格仅对应一台备用载具的开销——可提前购买多台，但作为消耗品每次出击都会用掉一份。",
    "Allows you to join an air battle activated by an ally on bomber or attacker (for example, in Tank Arcade Battles). In modes with respawn points, you can additionally reduce the aircraft spawn cost for each scouted player killed by an ally (for example, in Tank Realistic Battles).": "与空军基地保持联络，从而在一些游戏模式 (如陆战 • 街机娱乐) 中使用轰炸机、攻击机加入友军的空战事件。 在使用重生点的游戏模式 (如陆战 • 历史性能) 中，每当你所侦察的敌方单位被击毁，就能降低空军的重生点数需求。",
