    "Magach-3 \"Blazer\"": "夹克衫 爆炸反应装甲",
    "Maintenance and adjustment of tank brake system increases braking efficiency.": "维护、调校刹车系统，从而提高刹车效率。",
    "Maintenance and cleaning of the gun elevation mechanism increases its elevation speed. Gaps elimination improves pointing accuracy of the gun.": "维护高低机，消除转动间隙，从而改善俯仰速度和瞄准精度。",
    "Maintenance and lubrication of turret or gun traversing mechanism, lubrication of ball-bearing turret ring. These manipulations improve smoothness of movement at turret traverse, slightly increasing its speed.": "维护方向机，润滑座圈轴承，从而改善操作流畅度并小幅提升转速。",
    "Maintenance of transmission components, replacement of friction elements and nodes, lubrication of a gear box and adjustment of control rods. These manipulations improve tank handling ability, and decrease power loss of the transmission and final drives.": "更换离合片和万向轴，润滑齿轮箱，调节控制连杆，降低主减速器和传动装置的能量损耗，从而改善车辆操控性能。",
    "Makes it easier to find rage — briefly marks vehicles with a rage flag on the minimap when the scanner is activated.": "扫描仪启用后能够帮助猎手们定位距离最近的怒火战旗、在小地图显示大致方位，简化怒气值积累过程。",
    "Makes it easier to find resources on the map — marks them with a special marker when using binoculars and a scope.": "整合至望远镜与武器观瞄的设备，能够简化猎手们在地图中搜寻物资的过程。",
