    "Redan": "堡垒",
    "Redan-2": "堡垒-2",
    "Regular maintaining of cover and replacement of damaged cover parts increases overall durability and flight performance, due to weight reduction.": "保养并修复破损的蒙皮，从而提高防御强度和飞行性能。",
    "Regular maintaining of cover and replacement of damaged cover parts increases overall plane's durability and flight performance, due to weight reduction.": "保养并修复破损的蒙皮，从而提高防御强度和飞行性能。",
    "Repair parts and tools. A kit of spare parts and tools for performing minor repairs in the field.": "包含维修工具和备用零部件。装配后可在战场上进行一定程度的紧急维修。",
    "Replacement of Night Vision optics with updated Thermal Sensors.": "更换夜视观瞄设备，安装热成像传感器。",
    "Replacement of damaged airframe elements increases overall durability and flight performance due to weight reduction.": "更换受损的机体组件，提高结构强度的同时减去冗余重量，从而改善飞行性能。",
    "Replacement of damaged airframe elements increases overall plane's durability and flight performance due to weight reduction. For some planes it means that you get a new plane with undamaged airframe.": "更换受损的机体组件，提高结构强度的同时减去冗余重量，从而改善飞行性能。部分型号战机将直接换装为未受损的新机体。",
    "Replacement of damaged elements of fuselage skinning, removal of openings, and surface finish to reduce air drag.": "更换机身蒙皮、修复结构破损及打磨接缝起伏，从而减小空气阻力。",
    "Replacement of damaged elements of wing skin, removal of openings, and surface finish to reduce air drag.": "更换机翼蒙皮、修复结构破损及打磨接缝起伏，从而减小空气阻力。",
    "Replacement of worn engine with a new one.": "换装新发动机，从而提高输出功率。",
    "Replacement of worn helicopter blades with a new one.": "换装新旋翼桨叶，从而提高飞行性能。",
    "Replacement of worn tires improves handling ability and trafficability of the vehicle.": "更换新轮胎，从而改善车辆的操控和通过性能。",
    "Replacing helicopter blades": "更换旋翼桨叶",
    "Replacing the gun liner reduces fire spread.": "更换主炮的衬管，从而改善弹道散布。",
    "Replacing the propellers increases acceleration and maximum forward speed.": "更换老旧的桨叶，从而提升最大前进航速和加速性能。",
    "Replacing the rudder blades and steering mechanisms. Increases the ship's turning ability and decreases its turning time and radius.": "更换老旧的舵叶和转向结构，从而降低转向半径和耗时。",
    "Research of all modifications: {earnedExp} / {reqExp}": "改装件整体研发进度：{earnedExp} / {reqExp}",
