    "The %s mm cannons' worn barrels, trigger and striking mechanisms are replaced with new ones, to improve fire density and to decrease the chance of seizure.": "为 %s 毫米机炮更换新的炮管、扳机和击发装置，从而改善弹道散布并降低卡弹几率。",
    "The %s mm machine guns' worn barrels, trigger and striking mechanisms are replaced with new ones, to improve fire density and to decrease the chance of seizure.": "为 %s 毫米机枪更换新的枪管、扳机和击发装置，从而改善弹道散布并降低卡弹几率。",
    "The %s mm turret cannons' worn barrels, trigger and striking mechanisms are replaced with new ones, to improve fire density and to decrease the chance of seizure.": "为 %s 毫米自卫机炮更换新的炮管、扳机和击发装置，从而改善弹道散布并降低卡弹几率。",
    "The %s mm turret machine guns' worn barrels, trigger and striking mechanisms are replaced with new ones, to improve fire density and to decrease the chance of seizure.": "为 %s 毫米自卫机枪更换新的枪管、扳机和击发装置，从而改善弹道散布并降低卡弹几率。",
    "There were some technological issues when the Hispano cannon was converted to belt feed. Among them was the fact that the chamber width was 1/16 inch too large, which allowed backflow gases to enter the barrel and jam the breechlock. Reducing the size of the chamber width helped solve the problem and lessened the amount of weapon failures.": "1942 年的西斯帕诺 Mk II 改进版。由于技术上的纰漏，西斯帕诺机炮在改为弹链供弹设计后将药室做宽了一些。这样一来，气体反流便很容易进入炮管，进而导致闩锁卡死。将药室宽度减小 1/16 英寸后，这种逆流效应明显缓解，并最终延长了故障间隔时间。",
